  "notes": "CONJUGATION: Godan る-verb. {着飾|きかざ}る → {着飾|きかざ}って → {着飾|きかざ}った.\n\nUSAGE: A compound verb from {着|き}る (to wear) + {飾|かざ}る (to decorate). Implies dressing up beyond one's everyday attire, often for a special occasion. Usually positive in tone.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {華|はな}やかに{着飾|きかざ}る: to dress up splendidly\n- {美|うつく}しく{着飾|きかざ}る: to dress up beautifully\n- {着飾|きかざ}った{姿|すがた}: a dressed-up appearance",
